{
  "manifest_version": 2,
  "description": "Curated container acceptance cases backed by upstream regression expectations and one explicitly synthetic format corpus.",
  "limitations": [
    "The Docker acceptance manifest is curated; 75 fixtures have named upstream Go-test contracts that are recorded separately and are not claimed as executed by these runs.",
    "CLI archive scenarios cover ordinary/compressed files, TAR, 7z, tar.xz, tar.zst, ZIP, and 15 nested archive members; archive-bearing Git history remains INTERNAL_GO.",
    "Git staged-diff behavior is exercised through detect.TestFromGitStaged expectations; the complete configuration translation matrix remains INTERNAL_GO.",
    "Symlink testing requires the Docker helper image alpine:3.24; if it cannot be made available, that required fixture is reported UNSUPPORTED rather than passed.",
    "testdata/repos/nogit/api.go contains the same AWS finding as main.go, but the upstream fingerprint in .gitleaksignore suppresses api.go. Relative in-container paths preserve that fingerprint and main.go remains the positive control.",
    "The small Git fixtures contain stale origin/main remote-tracking metadata. Only those remote refs are removed from disposable staged copies; upstream fixture data and commit objects are unchanged.",
    "These runs use Windows 11 with Docker Desktop/WSL2 Linux containers. Native Linux Docker Engine validation remains a separate follow-up; the harness does not build the Gitleaks image."
  ],
  "inventory": [
    {"glob": "testdata/repos/nogit/main.go", "root": "repo", "disposition": "COVERED", "reason": "Positive file-scan expectation is verified in detect.TestFromFiles.", "tests": ["nogit-positive", "ignorefile-api-suppression"]},
    {"glob": "testdata/repos/nogit/api.go", "root": "repo", "disposition": "COVERED", "reason": "The AWS finding is suppressed by the fixture's fingerprint entry, as verified by detect.TestFromFiles.", "tests": ["ignorefile-api-suppression"]},
    {"glob": "testdata/repos/nogit/.env.prod", "root": "repo", "disposition": "COVERED", "reason": "Hidden environment-file expectation and config allowlist are verified against upstream fixture tests.", "tests": ["hidden-env", "allowlist-path"]},
    {"glob": "testdata/repos/nogit/.gitleaksignore", "root": "repo", "disposition": "COVERED", "reason": "Its api.go fingerprint is loaded by the CLI ignore-suppression scenario and asserted against both positive and forbidden findings.", "tests": ["ignorefile-api-suppression"]},
    {"glob": "testdata/repos/small/**", "root": "repo", "disposition": "COVERED", "reason": "Read-only staged copies support full history plus independently filtered per-file Git assertions from detect.TestFromGit.", "tests": ["git-history", "git-api-clean", "git-ignore-global", "git-ignore-commit", "git-readme-clean"], "scenario_fixtures": {"testdata/repos/small/main.go": ["git-history"], "testdata/repos/small/api/api.go": ["git-api-clean"], "testdata/repos/small/api/ignoreGlobal.go": ["git-ignore-global"], "testdata/repos/small/api/ignoreCommit.go": ["git-ignore-commit"], "testdata/repos/small/README.md": ["git-readme-clean"]}},
    {"glob": "testdata/repos/archives/**", "root": "repo", "disposition": "INTERNAL GO TEST ONLY", "reason": "Git history containing archive cases is asserted by detect.TestFromGit; this harness does not yet include its larger archive-history matrix.", "tests": []},
    {"glob": "testdata/repos/staged/**", "root": "repo", "disposition": "COVERED", "reason": "The staged Git CLI case asserts the one expected staged API finding from detect.TestFromGitStaged.", "tests": ["git-staged"]},
    {"glob": "testdata/repos/symlinks/**", "root": "repo", "disposition": "COVERED", "reason": "The CLI case checks --follow-symlinks; host symlink availability is evaluated per run.", "tests": ["symlink-file"]},
    {"glob": "testdata/archives/files/**", "root": "repo", "disposition": "COVERED", "reason": "Plain and compressed file expectations are verified in detect.TestDetectWithArchives.", "tests": ["archive-directory"]},
    {"glob": "testdata/archives/files.tar", "root": "repo", "disposition": "COVERED", "reason": "Two archive member findings are verified in detect.TestDetectWithArchives.", "tests": ["archive-tar"]},
